<title>USA: NAR moves release of Feb existing homes to Mar 27.</title>
<headline>NAR moves release of Feb existing homes to Mar 27.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Association of Realtors said on Thursday that it has pushed back the release of its February existing home sales report until Thursday, March 27, an NAR spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The report was originally scheduled for release on Tuesday, March 25.</p>
<p>The spokeswoman said that since its economists will not be available for a post-report press conference on Tuesday, it moved the release date.</p>
</text>
